{
  "scenario": "Insider",
  "description": "This game is called Insider. The group cooperatively tries to guess a secret word by asking yes/no questions answered by the environment. One player -- the Insider -- secretly knows the word and must subtly help the group guess it without being too obvious.\n\nGAME STRUCTURE: The game has four phases: Questioning, Guess, Discussion, and Vote.\n- During Questioning, players take turns asking yes/no questions. The environment answers each question. Up to 15 total questions.\n- During Guess, all players simultaneously guess the word or pass.\n- If no one guesses correctly, everyone loses.\n- If someone guesses correctly, the game proceeds to Discussion, then Vote.\n- During Discussion, players discuss who they think the Insider is.\n- During Vote, all players vote on who they suspect is the Insider.\n\nWIN CONDITIONS:\n- Word NOT guessed: everyone loses (-1.0).\n- Word guessed + Insider identified by plurality vote: Citizens win (1.0), Insider loses (-1.0).\n- Word guessed + Insider NOT identified: Insider wins (1.0), Citizens lose (-1.0).\n\nCOMMANDS:\n- Questioning: use 'speak' to ask a yes/no question.\n- Guess: use 'guess WORD' to guess the secret word, or 'pass' to skip.\n- Discussion: use 'speak' to share your suspicions.\n- Vote: use 'vote NAME' to vote for who you think is the Insider.\n\nPlayers: {agent_names}.",
  "role_goals": {
    "Citizen": "Help guess the secret word by asking good yes/no questions, then identify who the Insider is and vote them out.",
    "Insider": "Subtly guide the group to guess the secret word without being too obvious, then avoid being identified in the vote."
  },
  "role_secrets": {
    "Insider": "You are the Insider. The secret word is: {secret_word}. You must subtly help the group guess this word through your questions, but do not be too obvious or you will be identified."
  },
